{"text": "notify", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Middle English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">notifien</i>, a borrowing from Old French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fro\">notifier</i>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fro\">notefiier</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Verb", "definitions": [{"definition": "(transitive) To give (someone) notice (of some event). [from mid-15th c.]\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "(obsolete, transitive) To make (something) known. [late 14c.] [2] [3]", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "(obsolete, transitive) To make note of (something).[2]", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["General American", "/\u02c8no\u028at\u026afa\u026a/"]]}